-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions of seat person from part P1 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P1-cases-seat-person: cases for the seat layer of a person affected by an AI system: the facts a real person would state, one question after another.
-- Every question has at least one case; a case outside the encoding asserts the explicit NOTHING (not covered) where the question has one. The expected answers are written from the text,
-- one fact at a time, as in the layer-1 tests (P1-tests-*.l4). A case marked MIRROR asks the same facts as the partner seat's case file and the answers agree.

§ `Under Article 5: the prohibited AI practices`

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter II apply on the date asked?
-- the day before Chapter II applies (1 February 2025)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter II apply on the date asked` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the first day (2 February 2025)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter II apply on the date asked` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, does Article 5 additions apply on the date asked?
-- the day before the Article 5 additions apply (1 December 2026)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, does Article 5 additions apply on the date asked` (Date 1 12 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the first day (2 December 2026)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, does Article 5 additions apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(a) (subliminal, manipulative or deceptive techniques that distort behaviour)?
-- the facts of point (a)
-- MIRROR: the same facts are asked in P1-cases-seat-deployer.l4 (the deployer's question on the same provision), and the answers agree
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(a) (subliminal, manipulative or deceptive techniques that distort behaviour)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no significant harm: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(a) (subliminal, manipulative or deceptive techniques that distort behaviour)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- before Article 5 applies (1 February 2025)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(a) (subliminal, manipulative or deceptive techniques that distort behaviour)` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(b) (exploiting vulnerabilities due to age, disability or a specific social or economic situation)?
-- the facts of point (b)
-- MIRROR: the same facts are asked in P1-cases-seat-deployer.l4 (the deployer's question on the same provision), and the answers agree
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(b) (exploiting vulnerabilities due to age, disability or a specific social or economic situation)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no vulnerability exploited: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(b) (exploiting vulnerabilities due to age, disability or a specific social or economic situation)` (Date 3 2 2025) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- before Article 5 applies
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(b) (exploiting vulnerabilities due to age, disability or a specific social or economic situation)` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)?
-- a system generating intimate material of an identifiable person without consent, intended purpose
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)` (Date 2 12 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the person consented: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)` (Date 2 12 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- manipulation that does not increase the exposure: 'shall not constitute manipulation'
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)` (Date 2 12 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before point (ba) applies (1 December 2026)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- no intended purpose, no foreseeable outcome, the deployer does not use it for that purpose: paragraph 1a, 'only prohibited where'
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(ba) (generating or manipulating intimate or sexually explicit material of an identifiable person without consent)` (Date 2 12 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(bb) (generating or manipulating material or performance within Article 2, points (c) and (e), of Directive 2011/93/EU)?
-- material within Directive 2011/93/EU, intended purpose
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(bb) (generating or manipulating material or performance within Article 2, points (c) and (e), of Directive 2011/93/EU)` (Date 2 12 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a 'without right' defence applies: 'except where'
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(bb) (generating or manipulating material or performance within Article 2, points (c) and (e), of Directive 2011/93/EU)` (Date 2 12 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before point (bb) applies
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(bb) (generating or manipulating material or performance within Article 2, points (c) and (e), of Directive 2011/93/EU)` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(c) (social scoring)?
-- the facts of point (c), treatment (i)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(c) (social scoring)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither (i) nor (ii): not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(c) (social scoring)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- before Article 5 applies
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(c) (social scoring)` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(d) (risk assessments of natural persons based solely on profiling or personality traits)?
-- the facts of point (d)
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(d) (risk assessments of natural persons based solely on profiling or personality traits)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- supports a human assessment already based on objective and verifiable facts: 'shall not apply'
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(d) (risk assessments of natural persons based solely on profiling or personality traits)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not based solely on profiling: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(d) (risk assessments of natural persons based solely on profiling or personality traits)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

