-- no untargeted scraping: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(e) (untargeted scraping of facial images to create or expand facial recognition databases)` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- before Article 5 applies
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(e) (untargeted scraping of facial images to create or expand facial recognition databases)` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is the AI practice used on me prohibited by Article 5(1)(f) (inferring emotions in the workplace and education institutions)?
