-- not based solely on the output: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is a decision with an adverse legal effect on me barred under Article 5(3) where it rests solely on the output of a 'real-time' remote biometric identification system` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
