-- the decision rests solely on the output of a post-remote system, not a 'real-time' remote biometric identification system (Article 3(42)): not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 5, as a person affected by an AI system, is a decision with an adverse legal effect on me barred under Article 5(3) where it rests solely on the output of a 'real-time' remote biometric identification system` (Date 3 2 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
