-- P2-cases-seat-person.l4: cases for every question of P2-seat-person.l4, with the facts a real a person affected by an AI system would state. Expected values are written by hand from the text.

§ `The role and the applicability of the provisions`

-- an affected person located in the Union, after Chapter I applies
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a person affected by an AI system, does the Regulation apply to me as an affected person in the Union` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE `Established or located in the Union` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before Chapter I applies: not covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a person affected by an AI system, does the Regulation apply to me as an affected person in the Union` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE `Established or located in the Union` EQUALS NOTHING
-- located in a third country: outside the paragraph
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a person affected by an AI system, does the Regulation apply to me as an affected person in the Union` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE `Established or located in a third country` EQUALS NOTHING

-- the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a): 2 February 2025)
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day Chapter I begins to apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the first day of the text as amended
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- the day before Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system (Art 113(c)(i)): they do not apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 1 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day they begin to apply to an Annex III system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an Annex I system on 2 December 2027: its date is 2 August 2028 (Art 113(c)(ii))
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2027) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day before they apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2028) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 1 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day they begin to apply to an Annex I system
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2028) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- placed earlier and not significantly changed: saved by Article 111(2)
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- placed earlier and significantly changed since: covered
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a system that is not high-risk: no date of application, they do not apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 8, as a person affected by an AI system, does Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply on the date asked` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route neither` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Under Article 4a: processing special categories of personal data for bias detection and correction`

-- special categories (GDPR Article 9(1)) and every condition met
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- special categories by Directive (EU) 2016/680 Article 10 instead: still special categories (Art 3(37) is an OR)
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not special categories of personal data: the permission is not in point
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not met: appropriate safeguards for the fundamental rights and freedoms of natural persons are in place
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the provisions set out in Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680, as applicable, are also complied with
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the bias detection and correction cannot be effectively fulfilled by processing other data, including synthetic or anonymised data
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to technical limitations on the re-use of personal data, and state-of-the-art security and privacy-preserving measures, including pseudonymisation
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are subject to measures to ensure that the personal data processed are secured and protected, subject to suitable safeguards, including strict controls and documentation of the access, to avoid misuse and to ensure that only authorised persons have access to those personal data with appropriate confidentiality obligations
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are not transmitted, transferred or otherwise accessed by other parties
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the special categories of personal data are deleted once the bias has been corrected or the personal data has reached the end of its retention period, whichever comes first
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not met: the records of processing activities pursuant to Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and (EU) 2018/1725 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 include the reasons why the processing of special categories of personal data was strictly necessary to detect and correct biases, and why that objective could not be achieved by processing other data
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not strictly necessary: outside the grant
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the AI system is not high-risk: Article 4a(1) is not the paragraph (Article 4a(2) is)
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the last day of the text as enacted: Article 10(5) did not yet apply
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- before Chapter I applies
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 1 2 2025) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the party processing the data is not the provider of the system: the paragraph speaks of providers
#ASSERT `Under Article 4a(1), as a person affected by an AI system, may the provider of a high-risk AI system exceptionally process special categories of my personal data to ensure bias detection and correction` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

